            "summary": "England's strength lies in the collective according to Thomas Tuchel. \"If any team has heart and belief, then it's this team,\" he said after the victory over Mexico. But Jude Bellingham, together with Harry Kane, is showing the value of star quality too.",
            "fullText": "Between the Lines,unpicks the data behind football's biggest stories and reveals how Thomas Tuchel has helped take Jude Bellingham's game to new heights for England ahead of Saturday's World Cup quarter-final with Norway",
            "author": "Sky Sports Football Editorial Team",
